    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "When I was a little girl, I was very shy and never liked to speak up in class. I was always afraid of making mistakes in front of others."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Things changed when I joined the cheerleading team in the seventh grade. Our teacher taught me how to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "perform",
            "ref": "v-perform"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in front of many people. To improve my dancing skills, I practised as much as I could. After many performances, I gradually built up my confidence. Of course, I still sometimes make mistakes, but I have been able to accept them and learn from them."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Over the past few years, cheerleading has also taught me how to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "trust",
            "ref": "v-trust"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and work with others. At first, dancing in the group was not easy for me, but my team members have always been there to help me. We’ve become good friends. And now I do think that the success of our team is much more important than my own!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Cheerleading is more than just a sport to me. "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "Thanks to",
            "ref": "v-thanks-to"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " it, I have become a better student and team player. Being on the cheerleading team has made me the person I am today."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
